{"message":"Total trading assets for each year are the sum of 'trading assets – debt and equity instruments' and 'trading assets – derivative receivables'. For the increase from 2007 to 2008: (2008 debt/equity + 2008 derivative receivables) − (2007 debt/equity + 2007 derivative receivables). Amounts are in millions of dollars.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"(384102+121417)-(381415+65439)","sources":{"384102":"source:t1c2n0","121417":"source:t2c2n0","381415":"source:t1c3n0","65439":"source:t2c3n0"}}}